-36809">天下善士</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-36809-36821">一</note><seg source="#source-36821-36830">矣。夫</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="okurigana" rend="superscript" source="#source-36830-36848">レ</note><seg source="#source-36848-36860">戊辰之役</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="okurigana" rend="superscript" source="#source-36860-36878">ニ</note><seg source="#source-36878-36884">。正</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="okurigana" rend="superscript" source="#source-36884-36902">シ</note><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-36902-36914">レ</note><seg source="#source-36914-36917">名</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="okurigana" rend="superscript" source="#source-36917-36935">ヲ</note><seg source="#source-36935-36938">蹈</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="okurigana" rend="superscript" source="#source-36938-36956">ミ</note><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-36956-36968">レ</note><seg source="#source-36968-36971">義</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="okurigana" rend="superscript" source="#source-36971-36989">ヲ</note><seg source="#source-36989-37004">。血戰奪鬪</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="okurigana" rend="superscript" source="#source-37004-37025">シテ</note><seg source="#source-37025-37031">而斃</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="okurigana" rend="superscript" source="#source-37031-37055">レタル</note><seg source="#source-37055-37058">者</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="okurigana" rend="superscript" source="#source-37058-37076">ハ</note><seg source="#source-37076-37082">。乃</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="okurigana" rend="superscript" source="#source-37082-37100">チ</note><seg source="#source-37100-37124">天下之善士也。故</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="okurigana" rend="superscript" source="#source-37124-37142">ニ</note><seg source="#source-37142-37145">慕</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="okurigana" rend="superscript" source="#source-37145-37163">ヒ</note><note type="kunten" subtype=