      <div type="layout" source="#source-37624-37889" style="padding-inline-start: 4em; text-indent: -1em">
        <p><seg source="#source-37689-37853">（按）右は明治八年頃、有志戊辰戰歿者の追悼會を私學校に催ほし、翁に祭文を乞ひたるとき、翁の草したるものなり。</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p style="text-indent: 5em" rend="first-line-indent(5)"><seg source="#source-37893-37911">送</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="okurigana" rend="superscript" source="#source-37911-37929">ル</note><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-37929-37941">三</note><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-37941-37965"><rb>木尾</rb><rt>このを</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-37965-37983">君、日高君、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-37983-38010"><rb>救仁郷</rb><rt>くにがう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38010-38022">君三子之</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="okurigana" rend="superscript" source="#source-38022-38043">クヲ</note><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-38043-38055">二</note><seg source="#source-38055-38061">佛國</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="okurigana" rend="superscript" source="#source-38061-38079">ニ</note><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-38079-38091">一</note><seg source="#source-38091-38098">序</seg></p>
